    {
      "id": "cell_2",
      "order": 2,
      "label": "Bar Chart",
      "cell_type": "Markdown",
      "source": "## Bar Charts\n\nUse `Plot::bar` with `(&str, f64)` pairs. Great for categorical data.",
      "cargo_toml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cell_3",
      "order": 3,
      "label": "Bar Chart Example",
      "cell_type": "Code",
      "source": "Plot::bar(&[\n    (\"Rust\", 92.0),\n    (\"Python\", 78.0),\n    (\"TypeScript\", 65.0),\n    (\"Go\", 58.0),\n    (\"C++\", 45.0),\n])\n.title(\"Language Satisfaction (%)\")\n.y_label(\"Satisfaction\")\n",
      "cargo_toml": null,
      "collapsed": true,
      "saved_output": "[{\"Svg\":\"<svg width=\\\"800\\\" height=\\\"400\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 400\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n<rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"800\\\" height=\\\"400\\\" opacity=\\\"1\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\" stroke=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n<text x=\\\"400\\\" y=\\\"15\\\" dy=\\\"0.76em\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" font-family=\\\"sans-serif\\\" font-size=\\\"14.516129032258064\\\" opacity=\\\"1\\\" fill=\\\"var(--ip-plot-text, #82828C)\\\">\\nLanguage Satisfaction (%)\\n</text>\\n<line opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-grid, #8693AB)\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"2 5\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" x1=\\\"70\\\" y1=\\\"349\\\" x2=\\\"789\\\" y2=\\\"349\\\"/>\\n<line opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-grid, #8693AB)\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"2 5\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" x1=\\\"70\\\" y1=\\\"288\\\" x2=\\\"789\\\" y2=\\\"288\\\"/>\\n<line opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-grid, #8693AB)\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"2 5\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" x1=\\\"70\\\" y1=\\\"227\\\" x2=\\\"789\\\" y2=\\\"227\\\"/>\\n<line opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-grid, #8693AB)\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"2 5\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" x1=\\\"70\\\" y1=\\\"166\\\" x2=\\\"789\\\" y2=\\\"166\\\"/>\\n<line opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-grid, #8693AB)\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"2 5\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" x1=\\\"70\\\" y1=\\\"105\\\" x2=\\\"789\\\" y2=\\\"105\\\"/>\\n<line opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-grid, #8693AB)\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"2 5\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" x1=\\\"70\\\" y1=\\\"44\\\" x2=\\\"789\\\" y2=\\\"44\\\"/>\\n<polyline fill=\\\"none\\\" opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-axis, #7085A0)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" points=\\\"69,40 69,349 \\\"/>\\n<text x=\\\"60\\\" y=\\\"349\\\" dy=\\\"0.5ex\\\" text-anchor=\\\"end\\\" font-family=\\\"sans-serif\\\" font-size=\\\"9.67741935483871\\\" opacity=\\\"1\\\" fill=\\\"var(--ip-plot-muted, #79799A)\\\">\\n0.0\\n</text>\\n<polylin