    {
      "id": "cell_6",
      "order": 6,
      "label": "Combining Outputs",
      "cell_type": "Markdown",
      "source": "## Combining Plot with Data\n\nSince `Plot` produces an `Svg`, you can combine it with data output using tuples. The data flows to the next cell, and the chart displays alongside it.",
      "cargo_toml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cell_7",
      "order": 7,
      "label": "Plot + Data",
      "cell_type": "Code",
      "source": "// Compute statistics and visualize in one cell\nlet temps: Vec<f64> = vec![18.2, 22.5, 25.1, 28.7, 31.0, 33.4, 32.8, 30.1, 26.5, 21.3, 17.8, 15.2];\nlet months: Vec<(&str, f64)> = [\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\",\"May\",\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Aug\",\"Sep\",\"Oct\",\"Nov\",\"Dec\"]\n    .iter()\n    .zip(temps.iter())\n    .map(|(m, t)| (*m, *t))\n    .collect();\n\nlet avg = temps.iter().sum::<f64>() / temps.len() as f64;\n\n// Tuple: data for piping + chart for display\n(\n    format!(\"Average temperature: {avg:.1}°C\"),\n    Plot::bar(&months)\n        .title(\"Monthly Temperatures (°C)\")\n        .y_label(\"°C\"),\n)\n",
      "cargo_toml": null,
      "collapsed": true,
      "saved_output": "[{\"Text\":\"Average temperature: 25.2°C\"},{\"Svg\":\"<svg width=\\\"800\\\" height=\\\"400\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 400\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n<rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"800\\\" height=\\\"400\\\" opacity=\\\"1\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\" stroke=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n<text x=\\\"400\\\" y=\\\"15\\\" dy=\\\"0.76em\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" font-family=\\\"sans-serif\\\" font-size=\\\"14.516129032258064\\\" opacity=\\\"1\\\" fill=\\\"var(--ip-plot-text, #82828C)\\\">\\nMonthly Temperatures (°C)\\n</text>\\n<line opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-grid, #8693AB)\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"2 5\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" x1=\\\"70\\\" y1=\\\"349\\\" x2=\\\"789\\\" y2=\\\"349\\\"/>\\n<line opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-grid, #8693AB)\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"2 5\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" x1=\\\"70\\\" y1=\\\"265\\\" x2=\\\"789\\\" y2=\\\"265\\\"/>\\n<line opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-grid, #8693AB)\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"2 5\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" x1=\\\"70\\\" y1=\\\"181\\\" x2=\\\"789\\\" y2=\\\"181\\\"/>\\n<line opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-grid, #8693AB)\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"2 5\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" x1=\\\"70\\\" y1=\\\"97\\\" x2=\\\"789\\\" y2=\\\"97\\\"/>\\n<polyline fill=\\\"none\\\" opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-axis, #7085A0)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" points=\\\"69,40 69,349 \\\"/>\\n<text x=\\\"60\\\" y=\\\"349\\\" dy=\\\"0.5ex\\\" text-anchor=\\\"end\\\" font-family=\\\"sans-serif\\\" font-size=\\\"9.67741935483871\\\" opacity=\\\"1\\\" fill=\\\"var(--ip-plot-muted, #79799A)\\\">\\n0.0\\n</text>\\n<polyline fill=\\\"none\\\" opacity=\\\"1\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--ip-plot-axis, #7085A0)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" points=\\\"64,349 69,349 \\\"/>\\n<text x=\\\"60\\\" y=\\\"265\\\" dy=\\\"0.5ex\\\" text-anchor=\\\"end\\\" font-family=\\\"sans-serif\\\" font-size=\\\"9.67741935483871\\\" opacity=\\\"1\\\" fill=\\\"var(--ip-plot-mut